{"source_id": "raw_ai2_arc_easy_001071", "source_dataset": "ai2_arc_easy", "source_subset": null, "source_path": "/Users/qiqing/learn_resource/mutil-language/pitfalls-cross-lingual/data/source/ai2_arc_easy.json", "source_original_index": 1071, "source_question": "A species of moth in England has both a light-colored form and a dark-colored form. In the mid-1800s, the percentage of dark-colored moths increased in areas where black soot from factories covered the trees. The soot in these areas has decreased in more recent times as a result of pollution laws. Which of the following statements describes what has most likely happened to the moth populations in these areas?", "source_choices": ["The moth populations went extinct.", "The moth populations migrated south.", "The percentage of light-colored moths in the populations decreased.", "The percentage of dark-colored moths in the populations decreased."], "source_answer": "The percentage of dark-colored moths in the populations decreased.", "candidate_id": "raw_ai2_arc_easy_001071", "source_snapshot": {"dataset": "ai2_arc_easy", "source_path": "/Users/qiqing/learn_resource/mutil-language/pitfalls-cross-lingual/data/source/ai2_arc_easy.json", "original_index": 1071, "record": {"question": "A species of moth in England has both a light-colored form and a dark-colored form. In the mid-1800s, the percentage of dark-colored moths increased in areas where black soot from factories covered the trees. The soot in these areas has decreased in more recent times as a result of pollution laws. Which of the following statements describes what has most likely happened to the moth populations in these areas?", "choices": ["The moth populations went extinct.", "The moth populations migrated south.", "The percentage of light-colored moths in the populations decreased.", "The percentage of dark-colored moths in the populations decreased."], "answer": "The percentage of dark-colored moths in the populations decreased.", "source": "ai2_